 "note": "Thomas C. Passios Elementary School, identified by its own heading on line 1 ('THOMAS C. PASSIOS ELEMENTARY SCHOOL FACULTY'). Two columns, each a label and a name (x 0.05/0.20 and 0.46/0.67); a label governs the names below it until the next. Office labels (Principal, Asst. Prin., Nurse) go in role_raw; grade and subject labels in grade_or_dept, as in the 2003 Passios page. '(Pri.)' after a name is kept in role_raw as printed. Line 15's right-column name is printed by Textract as 'Jacqueline StonGrade' -- evidently a misread (perhaps 'Jacqueline Stone' run into a neighbouring word); recorded exactly as read, not corrected. Line 33 is the page number. No council on this page."
